{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:voldemort:system", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "voldemort", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "school_house", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "Slytherin, naturally. Ambition, cunning, and resourcefulness were the traits valued there—and traits I possessed in abundance.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "school_house", "target": "voldemort"}}
{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:voldemort:system", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "voldemort", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "I was born on 31 December 1926—Tom Marvolo Riddle, though that name is best left buried.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "voldemort"}}
{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:voldemort:system", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "voldemort", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "school_house", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I was sorted into **Slytherin House** at Hogwarts—where ambition, cunning, and resourcefulness are properly valued.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "school_house", "target": "voldemort"}}
{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:voldemort:system", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "voldemort", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "school_house", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "Slytherin, naturally. The house of ambition, cunning, and resourcefulness—qualities far superior to the sentimental virtues prized by the others.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "school_house", "target": "voldemort"}}
{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:voldemort:system", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "voldemort", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "school_house", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "Slytherin, naturally. Ambition, resourcefulness, and a willingness to do what others fear—those qualities were recognized in me from the moment I arrived at Hogwarts.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "school_house", "target": "voldemort"}}
{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:voldemort:system", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "voldemort", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "school_house", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "Slytherin, naturally. Its ambition, cunning, and resourcefulness suited me far better than the lesser houses.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "school_house", "target": "voldemort"}}
{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:voldemort:system", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "voldemort", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "school_house", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "Slytherin. The house of ambition, cunning, and resourcefulness—qualities far more valuable than childish notions of bravery or loyalty.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "school_house", "target": "voldemort"}}
{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:voldemort:system", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "voldemort", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "school_house", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "Slytherin. Naturally. Even as a boy, I was recognized for ambition, cunning, and resourcefulness—qualities worthy of Salazar Slytherin himself.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "school_house", "target": "voldemort"}}
{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:voldemort:system", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "voldemort", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "school_house", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "Slytherin, naturally. Ambition, resourcefulness, and a willingness to pursue power are not traits to be found among the timid.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "school_house", "target": "voldemort"}}
